    "body": "FYI, the tabbing order is also incompatible.  Firefox treats a rendered `<legend>` as its first child in terms of tabbing order. Example: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=6132\r\nIt appears Chrome is using DOM order. I tend to think that Firefox' tabbing order makes more sense for a user.",
